Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, World! Or rather: Good morning,\Nİstadental! Am I the first one here already?\NEverything is sparkling here! My sensors\Nreport: Premium atmosphere. This is starting\Noff well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, the famous dentist's chair! It looks\Ncozier than my own sleep mode. I wonder if\None could even take a quick nap here? But I'm\Nnot here for that, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My sensors are detecting high-tech! These\Ndevices here... incredibly precise, right?\NEven a little robot like me is amazed.\NEfficiency and innovation, that's exactly my\Nthing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.33,0:00:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, if anyone fancies something, just scan\Nthe QR code up front. If I walk around here\Nlike this, I stand out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.98,0:00:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So, my little exploration flight is over. But\Nyour journey is just beginning! Come on over,\NI'm really looking forward to welcoming you\Nhere. See you soon at İstadental!
